&lt;p&gt;Do you thrive in the ambiguity and possibility of early stage product design? We&#39;re looking for a bilingual Product Designer to help build intuitive, AI-driven experiences for government and enterprise clients across the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scale AI, we&#39;re building the future of AI through high-quality data and world-class design. Our products power critical decisions for businesses and governments worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
