&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3e48747501fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2350&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2edaaa51ac93&quot;&gt;Agent interoperability standards, including metadata, action formats, plugins, tools, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MCP&lt;/span&gt;, and agent-to-agent interfaces&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c2278d35936d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2476&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7d484d76e200&quot;&gt;Agent optimization, teacher-student distillation, skill generation, harness customization, and multi-agent learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2e5f22876f4a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2597&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e23538b8674&quot;&gt;Benchmarking and evaluation infrastructure for model, router, memory, skill, and harness changes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Some-examples-of-what-your-responsibilities-might-include-are:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebd0755d94ad&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2697&quot;&gt;Some examples of what your responsibilities might include are:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8068663e1eb&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
