&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;45bba6b0fc15&quot;&gt;Writing robust research software, APIs, integration layers, and test infrastructure that enable rapid but reproducible experimentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ffa65a7c79df&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c17d7f71806d&quot;&gt;Collaborating across research and engineering teams to translate promising ideas into secure, reversible, and reliable systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;61a217e16fac&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4141&quot; data-local-id=&quot;257cb02ef321&quot;&gt;Communicating results through technical reports, demonstrations, open-source releases, benchmarks, and research publications&lt;/p&gt;
