&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;171449f73536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5235&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6656d747143d&quot;&gt;Experience with APIs, data schemas, distributed services, testing, observability, code review, and CI/CD&lt;/p&gt;
